to the mayor's nephew again.

882
01:27:26,700 --> 01:27:29,035
What a fucking nutcase.

883
01:27:29,036 --> 01:27:32,581
Cross this line and I'll kill you.

884
01:27:33,874 --> 01:27:35,583
Officer Yim, Officer Yim?

885
01:27:35,584 --> 01:27:37,586
Why isn't this working?

886
01:27:39,380 --> 01:27:41,465
- Something wrong?
- No, no.

887
01:27:42,800 --> 01:27:44,969
